<title>POLAND: Izolacja sees '97 net up to PLN 15.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Izolacja sees '97 net up to PLN 15.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish insulation materials maker Izolacja SA expects its net profit this year to rise to 15.3 million zlotys from 11.4 million zlotys in 1996, the company said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The company said its sales were likely to rise to 166.7 million zlotys from 127.2 million zlotys last year.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
